Section 6: Testing Strategy & Output ArtifactsRisk-Based Testing: The agent must not aim for an arbitrary test-coverage percentage. Instead, the automated testing strategy must target the most dangerous system behaviors and edge cases at the API level (e.g., using Pytest or Jest/Supertest).   Required Test Cases: The agent must explicitly write and pass automated tests for the following critical scenarios:Concurrent Claims: Fire two parallel claim requests; verify exactly one succeeds while the other is rejected.   Stale Edits: Send an update with an outdated version number; verify the server rejects it and the data remains unchanged.   Idempotency: Transmit the same Idempotency-Key twice; verify that only one item is created and the same response is returned both times.   Workflow & Authorization: Verify that invalid state jumps are rejected, non-Lead approvals fail, and users receive a 403/404 when trying to access teams they do not belong to.